SpeexDSP 1.2.1 echo-cancellation subset, unchanged upstream sources.
Source: https://downloads.xiph.org/releases/speex/speexdsp-1.2.1.tar.gz
SHA-256: 8c777343e4a6399569c72abc38a95b24db56882c83dbdb6c6424a5f4aeb54d3d
Built with FLOATING_POINT and USE_KISS_FFT. Only the synchronous echo
canceller is used; no denoiser, automatic gain control or speaker model.
The public Quill wrapper is outside vendor/. License: COPYING; individual
source files retain their copyright/license notices, including KISS FFT.
